endobj

1304 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 312 0 R/E(But I began to see that gratitude was not an endorsement of injustice or a declaration that suffering was desirable. It was a way of refusing to let suffering dictate my entire inner experience. And yes, I sometimes treated adversity itself as a form of divine grace\204not because I could prove that every painful event had been sent for my benefit, but because I could choose to meet it in a way that fostered awareness rather than bitterness.)/Pg 67 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

1305 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 312 0 R/E(To some, I may have appeared crazy. But I began to wonder whether being considered crazy was preferable to remaining trapped in patterns that repeatedly made me miserable. After all, what is the greater folly: questioning your habitual interpretation of life, or unquestioningly allowing it to govern you?)/Pg 67 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

1306 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 312 0 R/T(7. My First Realisation: God as a Verb)/E(7. My First Realisation: God as a Verb)/Pg 67 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

1307 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 312 0 R/E(Eventually, I arrived at a conclusion that would once have sounded absurd to my former atheist self.)/Pg 67 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

1308 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 312 0 R/E(I had spent years debating whether God existed as a being, a person or a supreme entity. But my own experience was leading me towards a different understanding. Whenever something helped me move from turmoil towards clarity, from suffering towards solace, or from self-defeating patterns towards a more honest way of living, I experienced it as an expression of what I called God.)/Pg 67 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

1309 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 312 0 R/E(And then the idea struck me:)/Pg 67 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

1310 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 312 0 R/E(My journey had begun with a desperate demand:)/Pg 67 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

1311 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 312 0 R/E("Somebody out there, please save me from myself!")/Pg 67 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

1312 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 312 0 R/E(It had progressed through surrender, listening and gratitude. And now I was beginning to understand that the help I had sought might not arrive as a supernatural intervention. It could emerge through a counsellor's words, a colleague's uncomfortable advice, or a moment of awareness that interrupted my habitual suffering.)/Pg 67 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

1313 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 312 0 R/E(Perhaps the divine, if that is what one chooses to call it, need not always arrive with a halo and a heavenly announcement.)/Pg 67 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

1314 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 312 0 R/E(Sometimes, it arrives disguised as a psychologist who does not believe in God.)/Pg 67 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

1315 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 312 0 R/E(Sometimes, as a colleague who refuses to sympathise with your self-pity.)/Pg 67 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

1316 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 312 0 R/E(And sometimes, as a handkerchief you had never previously considered worth thanking anyone for.)/Pg 67 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

1317 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 312 0 R/E<FEFF092E09410915094D0924093F092C094B0927002D002000350036>/Pg 67 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

1318 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 312 0 R/E(Perhaps, as I now understand it, God is not merely a noun.)/Pg 67 0 R/K[15]>>
endobj

1319 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 312 0 R/E(God is a verb.)/Pg 67 0 R/K[16]>>
endobj

1320 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 312 0 R/E(Not merely something to worship, praise or petition\204but something I experience through the movement from confusion towards clarity, from resentment towards gratitude, and from self-deception towards honesty.)/Pg 67 0 R/K[17]>>
endobj

1321 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 312 0 R/E(This did not prove that God was a supernatural entity. It gave me a different way of understanding what I had been seeking.)/Pg 67 0 R/K[18]>>
endobj

1322 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 312 0 R/Pg 67 0 R/A[2200 0 R 0]/K[19]>>
endobj

1323 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 313 0 R/T(8. The First Path Was Only the Beginning)/E(8. The First Path Was Only the Beginning)/Pg 68 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

1324 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 313 0 R/E(My first lesson in Bhakti Marg was surrender. My second was listening. My third was gratitude. Each seemed to loosen the grip of the mind that had once dictated my life.)/Pg 68 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

1325 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 313 0 R/E(Yet a disturbing question remained. Had I genuinely loosened the grip of the ego\204or had my ego simply found a more sophisticated identity? Perhaps the ego that once boasted, "I can handle everything myself," could now boast, "I have surrendered to God.")/Pg 68 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

1326 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 313 0 R/E(The costume had changed.)/Pg 68 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

1327 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 313 0 R/E(But had the actor?)/Pg 68 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

1328 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 313 0 R/E(I had not found all the answers. I had not established whether God existed as an independent reality. I had not escaped every spiritual trap. But I had begun to question my habitual mind, listen more carefully and discover gratitude where I had previously seen only loss. Most importantly, I had stopped insisting that reality conform to my expectations before I was willing to engage with it.)/Pg 68 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

1329 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 313 0 R/E(And this was only the beginning. If surrender could loosen the grip of my own mind, another question was waiting in the wings:)/Pg 68 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

1330 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 313 0 R/E(Who, exactly, was surrendering\204and who was being transformed?)/Pg 68 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

1331 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 313 0 R/E(I had begun this journey seeking salvation from myself.)/Pg 68 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

1332 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 313 0 R/E(I was nowhere near finished questioning what that self actually was.)/Pg 68 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

1333 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 313 0 R/E<FEFF092E09410915094D0924093F092C094B0927002D002000350037>/Pg 68 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

1334 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 313 0 R/T(The Potter and the Clay)/E(The Potter and the Clay)/Pg 68 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

1335 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 313 0 R/E(A man had tried many ways to find peace\204meditation, prayer, and the advice of teachers. Each time, he became hopeful, but soon concluded, \215Nothing works.\216)/Pg 68 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

1336 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 313 0 R/E(One day, he visited an old potter shaping a lump of clay.)/Pg 68 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

1337 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 313 0 R/E(\215Can you make the clay take any shape you want?\216 he asked.)/Pg 68 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

1338 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 313 0 R/E(\215Only after understanding it,\216 the potter replied.)/Pg 68 0 R/K[15]>>
endobj

1339 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 313 0 R/E(As he worked, the potter\220s hand slipped, and the pot collapsed.)/Pg 68 0 R/K[16]>>
endobj

1340 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 313 0 R/E(\215Your hard work was wasted!\216 the man exclaimed.)/Pg 68 0 R/K[17]>>
endobj

1341 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 313 0 R/E(The potter smiled. \215Sometimes, the problem is not the clay, but the maker\220s grip.\216)/Pg 68 0 R/K[18]>>
endobj

1342 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 313 0 R/E(He continued, \215You must listen to the clay to know how much water and pressure it needs. And when the pot is complete, remember that your hands alone did not make it. Clay, water, and fire all played their part.\216)/Pg 68 0 R/K[19]>>
endobj

1343 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 313 0 R/E(The man fell silent. He recognised his own struggle in the potter\220s words. He had spent his life trying to make everything fit his expectations, dismissing every path that failed to give him the results he wanted.)/Pg 68 0 R/K[20]>>
endobj

1344 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 313 0 R/E(Perhaps peace did not require another method, but a different way of meeting life.)/Pg 68 0 R/K[21]>>
endobj

1345 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 313 0 R/E(He began to understand three lessons his search had overlooked: surrender, listening, and gratitude.)/Pg 68 0 R/K[22]>>
endobj

